{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人楊偉倫、鍾雪瑩、余香凝、田啟文、毛舜筠、謝君豪、朱栢康及導演何爵天等晚上（27日）出席電影《善男信女》慈善首映禮，電影於第63屆金馬獎榮獲包括「最佳男主角」及「最佳女主角」獎等9項提名。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;憑此片</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:01.142845+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T01:38:19.270895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:38:19.270895+00:00","content_hash":"3a2d7ee4105191914a02968b23e74283dbf1698ae8ae96ce6115b423132bce24","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}